one-minus-t folded into the multiplications
    float remaining = one - t;
----
    float remaining = 1.0f - t;
====
first term left-multiplied
    return ((a4 * three * remaining + t * a4) * t
----
    return ((three * a4 * remaining + t * a4) * t
====
remaining squared hoisted differently
            + remaining * remaining * (a3 * three)) * t
----
            + (remaining * remaining) * (a3 * three)) * t
====
end term uses a2*a2
           + remaining * remaining * (remaining * a2);
----
           + remaining * remaining * (remaining * a2) * a4;
